  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/04/IMG_4045.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Sent&iacute;o y Al alba!!! han transformado la Font de Dinsde Onda en un rinc&oacute;n rociero desde poco despu&eacute;s de las 13 horas. La primera copa de rebujito es gratis por gentileza de Les Tasques y L&#39;entrep&agrave;. Esta tarde habr&aacute; nuevos pases del espect&aacute;culo de la Pascua Rociera.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pascuarocierafontdins/img_4028.jpg\" alt=\"img_4028\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pascuarocierafontdins/img_4029.jpg\" alt=\"img_4029\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pascuarocierafontdins/img_4030.jpg\" alt=\"img_4030\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pascuarocierafontdins/img_4031.jpg\" alt=\"img_4031\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pascuarocierafontdins/img_4032.jpg\" alt=\"img_4032\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pascuarocierafontdins/img_4033.jpg\" alt=\"img_4033\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pascuarocierafontdins/img_4034.jpg\" alt=\"img_4034\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pascuarocierafontdins/img_4035.jpg\" alt=\"img_4035\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pascuarocierafontdins/img_4036.jpg\" alt=\"img_4036\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub